{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island of Hearts</strong> is a live-action interactive romance set on a breathtaking tropical island\u2014where every choice matters, and sunscreen is optional.<br>    <br>Step into a first-person love story filled with heartfelt moments, awkward encounters, and just the right amount of chaos. Will you fall for the fiery rebel, the shy artist, the confident leader\u2014or someone who completely derails your emotional stability?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/6405add2ec2938608e86f2aec13e20da.avif?t=1774513705\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras_big/6405add2ec2938608e86f2aec13e20da.avif?t=1774513705 width=1560 height=1072 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dialogue choices, actions, and emotional intelligence (or lack thereof) will shape your fate. There are multiple endings, hidden storylines, and probably at least one scene you\u2019ll instantly regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your heart\u2014or let fate do the heavy lifting. On this island, love isn\u2019t just in the air\u2014it\u2019s in <i>every questionable decision you make</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emily</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/413dd40184a9684dffc1b8c6823dc1b0.poster.avif?t=1774513705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/413dd40184a9684dffc1b8c6823dc1b0.webm?t=1774513705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/413dd40184a9684dffc1b8c6823dc1b0.mp4?t=1774513705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mia</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/82f1b07cd77d8fe7382e41524623fdfa.poster.avif?t=1774513705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/82f1b07cd77d8fe7382e41524623fdfa.webm?t=1774513705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/82f1b07cd77d8fe7382e41524623fdfa.mp4?t=1774513705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sophia</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/7f1e2c66d83571f737aea4feaa09cb40.poster.avif?t=1774513705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/7f1e2c66d83571f737aea4feaa09cb40.webm?t=1774513705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/7f1e2c66d83571f737aea4feaa09cb40.mp4?t=1774513705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lily</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/36dff7be25a6735f2f33e7630ecd248f.poster.avif?t=1774513705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/36dff7be25a6735f2f33e7630ecd248f.webm?t=1774513705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/36dff7be25a6735f2f33e7630ecd248f.mp4?t=1774513705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chloe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/eaecd135cf1ff20aa9c3994384cd032d.poster.avif?t=1774513705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/eaecd135cf1ff20aa9c3994384cd032d.webm?t=1774513705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/eaecd135cf1ff20aa9c3994384cd032d.mp4?t=1774513705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gabby</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/464a5bc54a466944142067e24b818010.poster.avif?t=1774513705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/464a5bc54a466944142067e24b818010.webm?t=1774513705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/464a5bc54a466944142067e24b818010.mp4?t=1774513705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victoria</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/6ffac9a099b0f19cca8f63afb1bffed3.poster.avif?t=1774513705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/6ffac9a099b0f19cca8f63afb1bffed3.webm?t=1774513705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/6ffac9a099b0f19cca8f63afb1bffed3.mp4?t=1774513705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Product Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the Romance \u2013 An Immersive First-Person Love Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See, feel, and awkwardly fumble your way through a fully acted romantic adventure told from your own eyes. Every glance, blush, and silent stare is your moment to shine\u2014or completely misread the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices, Your Fate \u2013 Multiple Endings, Hidden Surprises</strong>  <br>There\u2019s no \u201cright\u201d answer\u2014just the path you choose. Shape your destiny through heartfelt decisions, unlock secret scenes, and discover endings that prove every heartbreak was <i>totally worth it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Realism Starring</strong>\u00a0<strong>Some of Asia's Most Popular Content Creators</strong><br>This isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s a live-action, fully performed experience. Featuring real influencers, real emotions, and real palm trees. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Than Choices \u2013 Clues, Exploration, and Mini Games</strong><br>Because sometimes, love requires solving puzzles, finding clues, or winning a mini game that makes zero sense but somehow matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Will You Choose?</strong><br>Sweet, shy, bold, mysterious, alluring, or dazzlingly unpredictable\u2014choose wisely. Or don\u2019t. You\u2019ll probably still mess it up somehow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4Divinity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We publish games. Sometimes romantic, sometimes action-packed, sometimes both. Either way, we bring great stories from Asia to the world\u2014and occasionally to deserted islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Titan Digital Media</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creative brains (and faces) behind this adventure. Known for their influencer-driven storytelling, Titan brings the drama, charm, and probably the bloopers too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794770?t=1774513705","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794770?t=1774513705","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/04db4c04e3d38f6707b011162b3a777417361299/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774513705","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/04db4c04e3d38f6707b011162b3a777417361299/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774513705","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Island of Hearts is a live-action romantic adventure intended for adult audiences.\r\n\r\nThe game features frequent depictions of female characters in revealing clothing, such as bikinis, lingerie, and nightgowns. While there is no graphic nudity or visible genitalia, several scenes focus on sexual tension, flirting, and physical intimacy between consenting adults. This includes suggestive camera framing, dialogue with sexual connotations, and scenes where intimacy is strongly implied through context or fade-to-black transitions.\r\n\r\nSpecifically, players may encounter optional scenes with heavy sexual overtones, such as characters feeding each other in a suggestive manner or close-up shots emphasizing revealing attire.\r\n\r\nThe game also contains:\r\n\r\nViolence: Occasional mild, non-graphic physical altercations (scuffles) between characters.\r\n\r\nAlcohol: Visual depictions of characters consuming alcohol in social settings (bars, parties).\r\n\r\nAll sexual content is non-explicit and narrative-driven. The game does not contain any depictions of sexual assault, non-consensual acts, BDSM, hard drug use, self-harm, or graphic sexual violence."},"demos":[{"appid":4077910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island of Hearts</strong> is a live-action interactive romance set on a breathtaking tropical island\u2014where every choice matters, and sunscreen is optional.<br>    <br>Step into a first-person love story filled with heartfelt moments, awkward encounters, and just the right amount of chaos. Will you fall for the fiery rebel, the shy artist, the confident leader\u2014or someone who completely derails your emotional stability?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras/6405add2ec2938608e86f2aec13e20da.avif?t=1774513705\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794770/extras_big/6405add2ec2938608e86f2aec13e20da.avif?t=1774513705 width=1560 height=1072 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dialogue choices, actions, and emotional intelligence (or lack thereof) will shape your fate. There are multiple endings, hidden storylines, and probably at least one scene you\u2019ll instantly regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your heart\u2014or let fate do the heavy lifting.